  "description": "The imperial scribe Jurgen is devastated by the tragic death of his wife, Autilia. The perpetrator is none other than his closest friend, the crown prince, Sitri. Driven by obsession, Sitri’s ultimate goal is to claim Jurgen as his most prized possession, binding him forever in a web of control and desire. Unaware of the extent of Sitri’s obsession, Jurgen finds himself drawn deeper into a perilous trap.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n *Note: Part of Lezhin's Erofan Short Story Collection (에~로판 단편선) or the Steamy Collection in english.*",
